Short:        Adaptive layout with scrollers V0.3
Author:       feck@informatik.uni-kl.de (Christoph Feck)
Uploader:     feck informatik uni-kl de (Christoph Feck)
Type:         dev/src
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

New version of my fabulous "Scroll-your-screen-in-window" program :)
Features:
- adaptive layout of sliders and scroll arrows, all using BOOPSI.
- new subclass of propgclass featuring instanteous size adaption
  (GM_LAYOUT method, V39 only)
- new subclass of buttongclass with delayed repeat notifications.
- custom window backfill hook (well, the simplest one there is :)

Hope you can use it!
- Christoph

